# Real forwarded confirmations, for the A07/A08 paper check and for deriving
# fixtures. THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC: these carry names, itineraries, booking
# references and part card numbers, and a commit is world-readable for ever.
# What gets committed is the redacted fixture derived from them, never these.
.ai/qa/fixtures-inbound/
.ai/cezar/
# Note: .ai/scripts/ IS committed — the env launchers must be reproducible.

